# ── Trajectories and large binaries ───────────────────────────────────────
# A run's science lives in its text artifacts (metrics.json, record.json,
# result.txt, l4.json). The trajectory is 100-1000x larger and regenerable
# from spec + seed, so it is not tracked. Measured: 254 runs = 5.7 MB of text
# vs 542 MB of .gsd/.npz.
*.gsd
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.dcd
*.parquet

# ── Run outputs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Most of runs/ is regenerable, but NOT all of it. S1 readings, S2 predictions
# and rationale documents are LLM judgments that do not regenerate, and the
# prediction is the thing being sealed. So: track text, exclude binaries and
# per-run figures.
runs/**/figs/**
runs/**/observables.png

# Per-replica manifests of a seed-sweep. Measured on a k=1536 sweep: 3,534
# files / 14 MB whose provenance fields (code_hash, git_rev, env, env_hash)
# were *identical* -- only run_hash, seed and wall_s differed, and those three
# recompute from spec + seed. A replica sweep's science is its aggregate
# (metrics.json). Do not bleed 3,500 files into the history.
runs*/**/raw_early/**/manifest.json
runs*/**/raw/**/manifest.json

# ── Raw source material ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copyrighted PDFs (papers, book chapters). The distillations in
# knowledge/source/ are the in-git canonical form; the originals are fetched
# by each reader from the source_url in the distillation's frontmatter.
# See NOTICE.md.
*.pdf
knowledge/raw/

# Unpublished lab assets -- senior-student code, notes, unpublished
# parameters. Blocked pre-emptively: once committed it has to be scrubbed
# from the whole history, not just the tip.
knowledge/source/lab/

# ── Machine-specific ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Using another machine's performance profile is silently wrong -- the cost
# model then plans a sweep against hardware you do not have.
*.local.yaml
*.local.json
*.local.jsonl
.claude/settings.local.json
sessions/

# ── Session handoff notes ─────────────────────────────────────
# Working state for whoever picks up an unfinished task -- Korean, transient,
# and not part of the authored English surface. `docs/06-roadmap.md` is the
# published record of what is left to do.
남은일.md

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
